OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers plant 109,000 trees in
OL,4,Anew woodlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew woodlands have been created by
OL,7,Fvolunteers planting more than 109,000
OL,8,Ftrees across Lancashire in the last
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FMore than 1,200 volunteers from
OL,12,Fcommunities, landowners and
OL,13,Fenvironmental organisations have
OL,14,Fcreated woodland over an equivalent
OL,15,Farea of 154 football pitches, 61 new
OL,16,Forchards and 17 new micro-forests.
OL,18,FIn the last two tree-planting seasons,
OL,19,Fthe Lancashire Woodland Partnership has
OL,20,Fplanted almost 500,000 trees and more
OL,21,Fthan 27,233 metres of new hedges.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
