OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers plant 109,000 trees in
OL,4,Anew woodlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire County Councillor Joshua
OL,7,FRoberts said the woodlands were
OL,8,F"supporting wildlife, helping tackle
OL,9,Fclimate change, improving people's
OL,10,Fwellbeing".
